cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AI Product Testing — the course"
message: "If you use or adapt this material, please cite it and link to the canonical repository."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A hands-on course on evaluating products that embed AI: seven modules, eight
  exercises with worked solutions, and a capstone. Built around the Definition
  of Trustworthy (DoT), the acceptance gate for behaviour where several outputs
  are acceptable and exact comparison stops being a valid oracle.
